---
// JWT Algorithm Confusion (RS256 down to HS256) Attack vs Defense Diagram Component
---

<figure class="jwt-diag" aria-labelledby="jwt-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="jwt-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 390"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="jwt-diag-title jwt-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="jwt-diag-title">
      JWT 密鑰混淆攻擊（Algorithm Confusion: RS256 ➔ HS256）攻防流程
    </title>
    <desc id="jwt-diag-desc">
      展示攻擊者將非對稱 RS256 降級為對稱 HS256，利用公開的 Public Key 當作
      Secret 偽造簽名；伺服器端若未鎖定 algorithms
      參數則會誤判為合法，防禦方案為強制指定非對稱密鑰校驗。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="jwt-arrow-red"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="jwt-diag__arrow-head--red"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="20"
      width="830"
      height="350"
      rx="12"
      class="jwt-diag__card-bg"></rect>
    <text class="jwt-diag__badge" x="45" y="48"
      >CRYPTOGRAPHIC VULNERABILITY</text
    >
    <text class="jwt-diag__card-title" x="45" y="74"
      >JWT 密鑰混淆攻擊原理與縱深防禦 (RS256 ➔ HS256)</text
    >

    <!-- Step 1: Normal RS256 Expectation (x: 45, y: 95) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 95)">
      <rect
        width="790"
        height="52"
        rx="8"
        class="jwt-diag__step-box jwt-diag__step-box--blue"></rect>
      <text x="20" y="24" class="jwt-diag__step-num jwt-diag__step-num--blue"
        >1. 原本設計架構</text
      >
      <text x="20" y="40" class="jwt-diag__step-desc">
        伺服器預期使用非對稱加密 RS256：授權中心持【私鑰 Private Key】簽發，API
        閘道持【公鑰 Public Key】驗證。
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 2: Attacker gets Public Key (x: 45, y: 157) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 157)">
      <rect
        width="790"
        height="52"
        rx="8"
        class="jwt-diag__step-box jwt-diag__step-box--alert"></rect>
      <text x="20" y="24" class="jwt-diag__step-num jwt-diag__step-num--red"
        >2. 攻擊者取得公開公鑰</text
      >
      <text x="20" y="40" class="jwt-diag__step-desc">
        公鑰在架構中本就是公開的（如 JWKS 端點 /.well-known/jwks.json 或公開 PEM
        字串）。
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 3: Alg Confusion Exploit (x: 45, y: 219) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 219)">
      <rect
        width="790"
        height="58"
        rx="8"
        class="jwt-diag__step-box jwt-diag__step-box--red"></rect>
      <text x="20" y="24" class="jwt-diag__step-num jwt-diag__step-num--red"
        >3. 惡意修改 Header &amp; 對稱偽造</text
      >
      <text x="20" y="42" class="jwt-diag__step-desc jwt-diag__step-desc--red">
        攻擊者將 Header 的 alg 改為
        HS256（對稱加密），並直接以【公開公鑰字串】當作 HMAC Secret
        簽名，偽造管理員 Token！
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 4: Defense Comparison (x: 45, y: 287) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 287)">
      <!-- Bad Case -->
      <rect
        x="0"
        y="0"
        width="385"
        height="65"
        rx="8"
        class="jwt-diag__defense-box jwt-diag__defense-box--bad"></rect>
      <text
        x="16"
        y="22"
        class="jwt-diag__defense-title jwt-diag__defense-title--red"
        >❌ 脆弱驗證代碼</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="40" class="jwt-diag__defense-code"
        >jwt.verify(token, pubKey)</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="54" class="jwt-diag__defense-desc"
        >未鎖定算法，函式庫將公鑰當 Secret 驗證通過！</text
      >

      <!-- Good Case -->
      <rect
        x="405"
        y="0"
        width="385"
        height="65"
        rx="8"
        class="jwt-diag__defense-box jwt-diag__defense-box--good"></rect>
      <text
        x="421"
        y="22"
        class="jwt-diag__defense-title jwt-diag__defense-title--green"
        >✅ 安全縱深防禦代碼</text
      >
      <text x="421" y="40" class="jwt-diag__defense-code"
        >jwt.verify(token, pubKey, algorithms=['RS256'])</text
      >
      <text x="421" y="54" class="jwt-diag__defense-desc"
        >強制鎖死非對稱 RS256，收到 HS256 立即拒絕！</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="jwt-diag__mobile">
    <div class="jwt-mobile-card jwt-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="jwt-mobile-badge jwt-mobile-badge--blue">1. 原本設計</span>
      <h4>非對稱 RS256 驗證架構</h4>
      <p>• 授權中心持【私鑰】簽名發牌。</p>
      <p>• 微服務持【公鑰】校驗簽名，公鑰對外公開完全合法合規。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="jwt-mobile-card jwt-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="jwt-mobile-badge jwt-mobile-badge--red"
        >2. 攻擊者降級手法</span
      >
      <h4>Header 混淆 (RS256 ➔ HS256)</h4>
      <p>• 攻擊者修改 Header：<code>&#123; "alg": "HS256" &#125;</code>。</p>
      <p>
        • 將 Payload 改為 <code
          >&#123; "sub": "admin", "role": "root" &#125;</code
        >。
      </p>
      <p>
        • <strong>核心漏洞利用：</strong>直接拿公開的【公鑰 PEM 字串】當作 HS256
        的對稱 Secret 進行 HMAC 簽名！
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="jwt-mobile-card jwt-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="jwt-mobile-badge jwt-mobile-badge--green">3. 解決方案</span>
      <h4>強制白名單演算法</h4>
      <p>• 驗證端嚴禁依賴客戶端傳遞的 <code>alg</code> Header 參數。</p>
      <p>
        • 在代碼中硬編碼強制：<code>algorithms=['RS256']</code>，收到任何非
        RS256 憑證直接拋出安全異常並記錄告警日誌！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="jwt-diag-caption" class="jwt-diag__caption">
    圖二：JWT 密鑰混淆攻擊（RS256 降級為 HS256）與演算法白名單防禦
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .jwt-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .jwt-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .jwt-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .jwt-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* Card Background */
  .jwt-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .jwt-diag__badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .jwt-diag__card-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  /* Step Boxes */
  .jwt-diag__step-box {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-box--blue {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-box--blue {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-box--alert {
    stroke: #f97316;
    fill: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.04);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-box--alert {
    stroke: #fb923c;
    fill: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12);
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-box--red {
    stroke: #dc2626;
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-box--red {
    stroke: #f87171;
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-num {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-num--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-num--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-num--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-num--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .jwt-diag__step-desc--red {
    fill: #991b1b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__step-desc--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  /* Defense Boxes */
  .jwt-diag__defense-box {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-box--bad {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.05);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__defense-box--bad {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-box--good {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.05);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__defense-box--good {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.15);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__defense-title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-diag__defense-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-code {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .jwt-diag__defense-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  /* Mobile View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .jwt-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .jwt-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .jwt-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwt-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .jwt-mobile-card code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
